  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "麥片摻咖啡"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：</b><span><b>藍春瑞</b></span></span></p><div><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">穡頭舞到9點，iau-sâi kah想beh食寡mih件止饑，揣著麥片tsiah沖好niâ，雄雄影著桌頂有便利包ê咖啡，拆開就kā摻--落-去。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我慣勢10點準時去睏，目睭未kheh進前，lóng ē先看一點仔冊，thang khah好落眠，khah ē知影時鐘tân 11下，iáu金金leh掀hit本小說；姑不將就kā房間禁hōo暗眠摸，想beh緊睏，thang khah早起來做代誌。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Píng來píng去，被單弄起弄落，干干仔睏bē ka-tsuē；有聽著二樓leh做守衛ê阿義，翻點落班tńg來piànn-tn̄g、洗衫，tse iáu輕báng-báng，無kài大聲；m̄-koh，phih-pheh叫ê淺拖仔聲，顛倒聽kah明明明，tsia行hia趖，mā m̄知影tī時，伊tsiah恬--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">雄雄目睭thí金，巷仔頭ê路燈仝款光iānn-iānn，四箍liàn-tńg靜kah有聽著阮某小可leh kônn，mā有聽著遠遠杜猴leh hainn，伸手sa亂鐘看，tsiah 3點niâ，家己tī心肝內想，iáu早--leh，bóng koh bî--一-下，tsit-tsūn若m̄ siàng大眠，是beh等tang時--leh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">自án-ne夢天夢地，夢hāu-hia夢飯lē，beh醒m̄醒ê時tsūn，「pho̍k……pho̍k……」叫ê機車，tī亭仔跤tng-leh起動，我知影是四樓ê阿旺beh出門送報紙，應該是5點半無m̄-tio̍h；即時koh bih入去被內，想講koh nuà--一-睏，上班mā iáu ē赴。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">盤山過嶺到tsit个庄跤所在，入去一間八音、鑼鼓tshiâng-tshiâng滾tng-leh做醮ê大廟，前埕、後殿nǹg來nǹg去ê時tsūn，無細膩suah kā供桌頂ê王梨e落來塗跤，kenn一下險phih-phak-ànn；tsiah知影活beh吵死--ê是門外大路ê車聲，翻身lìng起床，kha-tshng後bē輸有鬼leh jiok án-ne，無khà食早頓，衫凊彩mua--leh，三hua̍h做兩hua̍h tiô到停車場；趕kah規粒心肝phi̍h-pho̍k-tshíng，拚性命tsông到學校，拄好8點赴簽到。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">閒時我有leh lim老人茶，íng過mā bat lim過咖啡，koh m̄是一kái、兩kái niâ，lóng無礙--著；tsit kái suah暗頭仔食西瓜，半暝仔反症；是m̄是人老--ah，我mā m̄知。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: small;\">（</b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：</b></span><span><span style=\"color: #0000ee; font-size: x-small;\"><b><u><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/AKQXRY\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/AKQXRY</a></u></b></span><b style=\"font-size: small;\">）</b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><b style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b style=\"font-size: small; text-align: left;\"><br /></b></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiGqqBEm6hzxU5rDJmkz3V56Wds29yrmyfAvWnc3_y1IMpKsFOxgTwxWJ7-7A7atSVuRAPgVxZNIBXA1JT1dXLxbpuLEpllMLt6Fz4AX_Dd2TK5wSiwZMOPSFzGFrG4uS3eKYR8FcVmiZUDEIySFDkwSinLy9jG2SR0fpc0Le11S2Fqeq_bBf6OUZcWWA/s1424/337%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiGqqBEm6hzxU5rDJmkz3V56Wds29yrmyfAvWnc3_y1IMpKsFOxgTwxWJ7-7A7atSVuRAPgVxZNIBXA1JT1dXLxbpuLEpllMLt6Fz4AX_Dd2TK5wSiwZMOPSFzGFrG4uS3eKYR8FcVmiZUDEIySFDkwSinLy9jG2SR0fpc0Le11S2Fqeq_bBf6OUZcWWA/w450-h640/337%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></